Require vhs
Output .tape/bootstrap-renderer-preview.gif
Output .tape/bootstrap-renderer-preview.mp4
Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1100
Set Height 650
Set FontSize 18
Set Padding 32
Set MarginFill "#111827"
Type "bash .tape/bootstrap-renderer-preview.sh"
Enter
Sleep 7s
Show
Screenshot .tape/bootstrap-renderer-preview.png
